格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Git worktree management panel for the DSH Web GUI — adds a project → worktree → sessions dimension to the sidebar.","id":"gh:1338063042","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-worktree-panel","slug":"HeathHe/dsh-worktree-panel","topics":["branch-management","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","worktree"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Git worktree management panel for the DSH Web GUI — adds a project → worktree → sessions dimension t"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"anagement panel for the DSH Web GUI — adds a project → worktree → sessions dimension to the sidebar."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-worktree-panel"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A Git worktree and branch-management panel for the DeepSeek Harness Web GUI. It extends the official"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" workspace/session sidebar with a **project → main working tree / branch worktree → session** hierar"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"chy while preserving the original workspace interactions."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"### Install"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Restart `dsh web` after installation. The worktree hierarchy will then appear in the workspace sideb"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"tart `dsh web` after installation. The worktree hierarchy will then appear in the workspace sidebar."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Install a specific version:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Upgrade"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Local development"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- **Main working tree + branch worktrees** — displays the main working tree, current branch, clean/m"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"odified state, and linked branch worktrees inside each project group.\n- **Session management** — sta"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"rts sessions inside a worktree, removes worktrees, and switches the main working tree branch.\n- **On"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"e-click creation** — creates a worktree for an existing branch or creates a new branch and its workt"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"ree.\n- **Session-first non-Git folders** — the project-row plus button starts a conversation directl"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"y. “Initialize Git and enable worktrees” is available from the project actions menu.\n- **Configurabl"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"e storage** — stores worktrees in `<project>/.dsh/workspaces/` by default or in a custom global dire"},{"id":"p16s8","text":"ctory.\n- **Safe migration** — detects and migrates existing worktrees when the storage location chan"},{"id":"p16s9","text":"ges, while skipping worktrees with uncommitted changes or active sessions.\n- **Progressive enhanceme"},{"id":"p16s10","text":"nt** — non-Git workspaces retain the default session workflow and only gain an optional Git/worktree"},{"id":"p16s11","text":"t workspaces retain the default session workflow and only gain an optional Git/worktree initializer."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- Tested with **DSH Desktop 2.0.3 / DeepSeek Harness 0.1.1-rc.2**.\n- DSH peer dependency range: `>=0"},{"id":"p18s2","text":".1.1-rc.2 <0.2.0`.\n- Uses a dedicated Worktree settings page through `settings.section`.\n- Supports "},{"id":"p18s3","text":"the current Host description store and home-directory path abbreviation."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### Generated client bundle"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"`lib/client.js` is generated by `lib/build.mjs` from the official `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-worksp"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ace` browser bundle. The build validates the upstream package version and records it in the generate"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"undle. The build validates the upstream package version and records it in the generated file header."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The build also synchronizes `dsh.client.external` in `package.json` with the modules required by the"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" client bundle, so DSH loads their code before starting the plugin. The `inject` service declaration"},{"id":"p21s3","text":" does not replace this module-loading declaration."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Use an explicit upstream bundle when needed:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"MIT. `lib/client.js` is derived from `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-workspace`; see `NOTICE` and `LICEN"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" `lib/client.js` is derived from `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-workspace`; see `NOTICE` and `LICENSE`."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
